_name": "\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe5.png", "id": "1176064210854982", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393901_1176064214188315_5791055776969345898_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=55PcNt_mFmQQ7kNvwESk5_o&_nc_oc=AdoBVcoNUYfsQvW4lralkGILdaEHH12dvMefVc6o2_s43J934CbK_EaXUqfCYzXjtyw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1bdJOdwM_xsCMWKZRDfCaKDHz6P381MLkrJUfRoOuFVQ&oe=69F1E779"}, {"file_name": "\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe3.png", "id": "1287903762319465", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1287903765652798_3313975889312284138_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=501VCQsllroQ7kNvwHhZ9O2&_nc_oc=AdqHpfa0-dbRrJbhgJtQoDve1T0f7iKBit5NGOgxGU4hltJQlN-AgRaPKatBYz-o0Hw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2O8D92Ab9QI1UEK1dYadiKkm72IK-W-6vGwxZTrv6NqA&oe=69F20E67"}, {"file_name": "\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe1.png", "id": "551538804081128", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392010_551538807414461_9150926764574295790_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cD4BCGP1_NwQ7kNvwH9bkzu&_nc_oc=AdpK4fCXTyNVYHciFcznyE5V7WKPIqNzNyU2rbeXz_oc_uvQrJlA7vbnsvamRGnoAqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0zjVAEZtFkQ7YI8ID_URQp8nqvkYjgA75lKiokYmWRfA&oe=69F208E1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u4e3b\u89c6\u89c92560x1440.png", "id": "1026152272694074", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393491_1026152279360740_983069621863544605_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aEu62MeBKFIQ7kNvwHa7Br2&_nc_oc=Adr6e_2uu24sweFCdN3CmU3qD77Mzih6Ym7QsuDKxHo-TqFMeYtWudpShHXSh-HnxK4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0FoPNozYeuUNi9i97XSvYIs55hyMR4wDnJQ4wdKhALrw&oe=69F20A26"}, "display_name": "Bearly Escape", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83d\udc3b **Explore the Dreamlike World of Everwood**\n\nYour loyal dog, Robin, has vanished! Embark on a thrilling journey to track him down through Everwood\u2014a dreamlike world teeming with mystery, danger, and secrets.\n{1811049976105148}\n\n\ud83c\udf32 **Escape Evil\u2019s Clutches, Save the Wilderness**\n\nThe animals have been kidnapped, transformed into stuffed toys, and trapped in claw machines. Can you outsmart their captor and bring them home?\n{630825093440681}\n\n\ud83e\udde9 **Solve Puzzles & Outsmart the Wicked Dr. Kidd**\n\nCrack tricky puzzles to sneak into Dr. Kidd\u2019s secret labs and foil his dark experiments.\n{515737491356413}\n\n\ud83d\ude81 **Master the Claw in VR**\n\nTake control of a high-tech drone claw to rescue animals trapped in claw machines. Precision is key!\n{662933953101831}\n\n\ud83c\udfae **Escape in Platforming Challenges**\n\nGuide rescued animals to safety through platforming levels with branching paths, dangerous obstacles, and sneaky dodging traps while collecting rewards.\n{2111832012564145}\n\n\ud83c\udf31 **Restore Nature**\n\nEvery animal brings life back to Everwood, transforming the barren wilderness back into a thriving ecosystem!\n\n{966180982164367}\n\ud83c\udfc6 **Compete, Collect & Conquer**\n\nRescue more than 40 animals, climb the global leaderboard.\n\n\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n\u2714 **Immersive VR Adventure** \u2013 Solve puzzles, rescue animals, and take down Dr. Kidd.\n\n\u2714 **Cinematic Storytelling** \u2013 Unravel a gripping mystery while exploring an imaginative world.\n\n\u2714 **Dynamic Claw Machine Mechanics** \u2013 Test your skills in virtual claw machine gameplay \u2013 with extra twists!\n\n\u2714 **Puzzle Platforming** \u2013 Outsmart enemies and traps, discover secret escape routes, and find hidden rewards.\n\n \ud83d\udc3bAre you ready to claw your way to freedom?\ud83d\udc3b\n\n", "short_description": "Bearly Escape is a VR adventure puzzle game where kidnapped animals are transformed into stuffed toys and trapped in claw machines. Can you outsmart the sinister scientist Dr. Kidd and bring them home?"}]}, "developer